,"text":"We looked thru it and there were two men down there.","camera":{"mode":"orbit","target":"pit","distance":9,"height":8,"angle":200},"actions":[{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"kneel"},{"actor":"steve","yaw":0,"state":"kneel"},{"actor":"man_one","at":0.15,"for":0.25,"state":"idle","appear":true},{"actor":"man_two","at":0.15,"move":[1,-4,22.9],"state":"walk","appear":true},{"actor":"me","for":0.2,"move":[-0.1407,0,20.6229],"path":"line"},{"actor":"steve","for":0.2,"move":[0.3666,0,20.6399],"path":"line"}]},{"dur":9,"text":"We wanted to go down there. I yelled down and one man didn't want to move.","camera":{"mode":"orbit","target":"pit","distance":8,"height":7.5,"angle":240},"actions":[{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"yell"},{"actor":"steve","yaw":0,"state":"kneel"},{"actor":"man_one","yaw":180,"state":"pockets"},{"actor":"man_two","at":0.4,"state":"idle"},{"actor":"me","for":0.2,"move":[-0.1407,0,20.6229],"path":"line"},{"actor":"steve","for":0.2,"move":[0.3666,0,20.6399],"path":"line"}]},{"dur":6,"text":"I was going to drop in a rock.","camera":{"mode":"follow","target":"me","distance":6,"height":3,"angle":35},"actions":[{"actor":"rock","at":0.1,"for":0.25,"appear":true},{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"kneel"},{"actor":"steve","yaw":0,"state":"kneel"}]},{"dur":10,"text":"There were a lot of weeds on the grating, so we made a fire and burned the weeds.","camera":{"mode":"orbit","target":"pit","distance":9,"height":6,"angle":210},"actions":[{"actor":"me","yaw":0,"state":"kneel"},{"actor":"steve","yaw":0,"state":"kneel"},{"actor":"fire","at":0.15,"for":0.25,"state":"grow","appear":true},{"actor":"smoke","at":0.35,"for":0.25,"appear":true},{"actor":"weeds","at":0.3,"color":"#5a3a1e"},{"actor":"weeds","at":0.65,"for":0.25,"vanish":true},{"world":{"fogColor":"#6a5347","ambient":"#6a5348","sunColor":"#ffa860"}},{"at":0.2,"effect":"flash"}]},{"dur":10,"text":"Then we were down in the hold. It was like a cave and there was a cafe there.","camera":{"mode":"fixed","target":